\f0\fs24 \cf0 This folder contains the UX mock of my process mining agentic saas named Namuda.\
\
My vision for this is that the UX is a constant onboarding, where the goal is continuous improvements within the solution.\
\
I also want an ultra modern flow, inspired by the collaborative feeling of working with claude, (multi) choice questions, tone of voice.\
\
In general, I want som general building blocks:\
Canvas - Everything happens on a canvas, so there are floating modals, dynamic transitions. This is because the main analytical view is on the canvas.\
Educational - Chat is not available, Namuda speaks to in text and illustrations.\
Chat - Collaborative tone, assume, propose, correct, possible choices.\
Chat B - Namuda shows a widget, with some text, and choice with question and possibility to accept.\
Chat C - Namuda shows a dynamic document, like process context, data quality, that is gradually filled through conversation\
Accept - If you have completed a document, like process context, you are presented with a proofreading view, where choices are refine or accept.\
Later in the want great notifications (teams, slack,email))and entry points\
\
For now this is the first part of the onboarding process for a new user.\
\
Review the current flow as a start, plan the next iteration v7 iteration.\
